title: A new file is staged and then changed again: discarding its changes must give the staged text back (or at least say something clear); the file must not keep the later line
folders: git-mixed
expect-file: git-mixed/added.txt :: ^added and staged\n$
forbid-log: script: ignoring
forbid-log: nothing offers

wait 3000
left changes
touch added.txt changed after staging
wait 2500
mark 1-added-and-modified
wait 500
git discard added.txt
wait 600
mark 2-asked
wait 500
answer Discard
wait 1500
mark 3-end
wait 500
quit
